msgid "A system update is ready. Restart the computer to finish installing it."
msgstr "Uhlaziyo lwenkqubo lulungile. Qala kwakhona ikhompyutha ukuze ugqibezele ukulufaka."

msgid "System files need repair. This happens automatically the next time the computer restarts."
msgstr "Iifayile zenkqubo zifuna ukulungiswa. Oku kuya kwenzeka ngokuzenzekelayo xa ikhompyutha iqala kwakhona."

msgid "The web browser is not installed yet."
msgstr "Ibhrawuza yewebhu ayikafakwa."

msgid "The web browser is ready. Sign out and sign in again to see it."
msgstr "Ibhrawuza yewebhu ilungile. Phuma uze ungene kwakhona ukuze uyibone."

msgid "This app is not available on this device"
msgstr "Le app ayifumaneki kwesi sixhobo"

msgid "This app's lock settings are not in effect, so it cannot start. Please ask your teacher."
msgstr "Iisetingi zokutshixa zale app azisebenzi, ngoko ayinakuqala. Nceda ubuze utitshala wakho."

msgid "Could not end your session. Please sign out and open this app from the sign-in screen."
msgstr "Ayikwazanga ukuphelisa iseshoni yakho. Nceda uphume uze uvule le app kwiscreen sokungena."

msgid "This will end your session and open %s in locked mode."
msgstr "Oku kuya kuphelisa iseshoni yakho kuze kuvule i-%s kwimo etshixiweyo."

msgid "Newer settings could not be fetched. Please contact IT."
msgstr "Iisetingi ezintsha azikwazanga ukulandwa. Nceda uqhagamshelane ne-IT."

msgid "Settings have not been confirmed up to date for %s days. Please connect to the network; if this persists, contact IT."
msgstr "Kudlule iintsuku eziyi-%s kungaqinisekiswanga ukuba iisetingi zihlaziyiwe. Nceda uqhagamshele kwinethiwekhi; ukuba oku kuyaqhubeka, qhagamshelana ne-IT."

msgid "IT is collecting diagnostic info from this computer."
msgstr "I-IT iqokelela ulwazi lokuxilonga kule khompyutha."
